==Battleground==
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 12.67~15.33 seconds<sup>380f~460f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Since this stage is filled with just [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating Enemies]], using any of the [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Anti-Floating Cats]] will easily clear this stage.

